    "content": "<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none;\"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style></head><body dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Thanks Jordan.</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">My view: we can ship without the full REL-219 fix if we cap previews at 20 MB and show a download button above that. It's a small config change.</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Devon, does that work for you, and can REL-212 land by Thursday?</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Alex</div><div id=\"appendonsend\"></div><hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div id=\"divRplyFwdMsg\" dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:11pt\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> Jordan Ito &lt;jordan.ito@example.com&gt;<br><b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, October 13, 2026 1:25 PM<br><b>To:</b> Emery Ellis &lt;emery.ellis@example.com&gt;; Alex Example &lt;you@example.com&gt;; Devon Dahl &lt;devon.dahl@example.com&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> RE: Release 2.4 go/no-go</font><div>&nbsp;</div></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">The regression suite finished on staging: <b>1,284 passed, 3 failed</b>.</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">The three failures:<ul><li>Two are the known REL-219 problem (large PDF preview).</li><li>One is a flaky timing test in calendar sync; it passed on re-run.</li></ul></div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">So QA is green apart from REL-219.</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Jordan</div><div id=\"appendonsend\"></div><hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div id=\"divRplyFwdMsg\" dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:11pt\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> Emery Ellis &lt;emery.ellis@example.com&gt;<br><b>Sent:</b> Monday, October 12, 2026 8:00 AM<br><b>To:</b> Alex Example &lt;you@example.com&gt;; Devon Dahl &lt;devon.dahl@example.com&gt;; Jordan Ito &lt;jordan.ito@example.com&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Release 2.4 go/no-go</font><div>&nbsp;</div></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Hi all,</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Release 2.4 is scheduled to ship on <b>Monday, October 19</b>. Go/no-go is this Friday at 15:00. Current blockers:<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\" align=\"left\">Issue</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\" align=\"left\">Owner</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\" align=\"left\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">REL-212 Sync stalls after sleep/wake</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Devon</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Fix in review</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">REL-219 Attachment preview fails on large PDFs</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Devon</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Open</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">REL-224 Regression suite on staging</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Jordan</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Running</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Please keep this thread updated as things change. Release checklist: <a href=\"https://example.com/releases/2.4/checklist\">https://example.com/releases/2.4/checklist</a></div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Thanks,<br>Emery</div></body></html>"
